From: Rob Vogelaar <rob.vogelaar@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] metrics: complete unassociated candidate RCPI transaction

Route a standard Unassociated STA Link Metrics Query to the radio supporting
the requested operating class, invoke OneWifi's real per-VAP GetNaSta method,
decode its actual response schema, and retain the resulting 1905 metrics.

Expose retained candidate metrics through get_sta and make the HTTP POST wait
for a fresh matching response instead of reporting success after submission.
Also provide a read-only result endpoint.  Provider metadata makes it explicit
that hwsim measurements are simulated radio truth supplied through the HAL.

